# Kilo agent worktrees — a full nested copy of the repo, plus agent session
# state. Never version it: it duplicates src/ wholesale and churns on every
# agent run.
.kilo/

# The agent office (hive/) lives INSIDE this repo but is not part of the game.
# Never version it: it holds every agent's memory.md, inboxes, session state and
# crash logs, and it churns constantly. Without these, a bare `git add -A` stages
# 70+ office files into the game. Found by the games-1 baseline audit.
hive/
palace/
roster.json
roster-backups/
hallways.json

# Agent git worktrees created inside the repo (one per concurrent temp). Each
# is a full checkout of the source tree, so a bare `git add -A` would commit a
# nested copy of src/ and api/ under worktrees/. Same hazard as hive/ above.
worktrees/
